---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="relative border-t border-bone-50/8 pt-24 pb-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-16 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display max-w-3xl text-display-lg font-medium tracking-tight-display text-bone-50">
          One number. No upsell.
          <span class="text-bone-400">Ready when you are.</span>
        </h2>
        <a
          href="#convert"
          class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-lime-accent px-7 py-4 font-medium text-ink-950 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          Back to converter
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 8h10m0 0L9 4m4 4l-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="square" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-sm lg:col-span-5">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono-tabular text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide-meta text-bone-400">Built on</span>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-bone-200">
            <li><a href="https://frankfurter.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-lime-accent">Frankfurter API</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.ecb.europa.eu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-lime-accent">European Central Bank</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-lime-accent">Astro · Cloudflare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono-tabular text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide-meta text-bone-400">Quick links</span>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-bone-200">
            <li><a href="#convert" class="hover:text-lime-accent">Converter</a></li>
            <li><a href="#pairs" class="hover:text-lime-accent">Popular pairs</a></li>
            <li><a href="#trend" class="hover:text-lime-accent">Historical trend</a></li>
            <li><a href="#why" class="hover:text-lime-accent">How it works</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-bone-50/8 pt-8 text-xs text-bone-400">
      <span class="font-mono-tabular">parity · {year}</span>
      <span class="font-mono-tabular">
        Reference data — not financial advice. Banks and remittance services apply their own spread.
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
